#: kcmkded.cpp:99
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This is a list of available KDE services which will be started on demand. "
"They are only listed for convenience, as you cannot manipulate these "
"services."
msgstr ""
"Esti ye un llistáu de servicios KDE disponibles que s'aniciarán so demanda. "
"Namái se llisten por información, darréu que nun pues manipulalos."

