#: kcmkded.cpp:120
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This shows all KDE services that can be loaded on KDE startup. Checked "
"services will be invoked on next startup. Be careful with deactivation of "
"unknown services."
msgstr ""
"Esto amuesa tolos servicios KDE que puen cargase nel aniciu de KDE. Los "
"servicios conseñaos invocaranse nel aniciu siguiente. Ten procuru cola "
"desactivación de servicios desconocíos."

